Files under this directory are copied over the same path in lineage/ by
scripts/prepare-tree.sh at the start of every build (rsync, no delete).

vendor/samsung/gts210ltexx-modem/proprietary/vendor/{bin/cbd,lib/*.so}
    Stock modem userspace for the LTE build (WITH_LTE=true, see the LTE block in
    device/gts210ltexx/device.mk, which installs these files to /vendor with PRODUCT_COPY_FILES).
    Unmodified copies from tools/stock-T815/T815XXU2CRH1/modem/ (Samsung firmware T815XXU2CRH1,
    the firmware of the CP image in the RADIO partition; provenance and sha256 in MANIFEST.txt
    there): bin/cbd is /sbin/cbd, lib/ is /system/lib/{libsec-ril,libfloatingfeature,
    libsecnativefeature,libprotobuf-cpp-full}.so.
        cbd                      91210237db3f59c6e7e3bd694c0d567c7024edee93db8827946f6df37f8bb2f9
        libsec-ril.so            09a08d07f76d89da8cca1b840f1405ad084ca05463519886effd983203252cd1
        libfloatingfeature.so    b837b0695017ed38f085850bf2c5b324f52189f2f51cf9337d87c72f69d63585
        libsecnativefeature.so   0e3b5868832940e998316eec2053885bb7051b924eb8b1ecae4a23d8512c44ab
        libprotobuf-cpp-full.so  0bee42215df983e3ec44a9805fc258bbec691380226d89ef2b8892dfc521e098
    Samsung blobs: not published (publish/export.sh copies only this README from
    tree-overrides/ and refuses to export if any of these files turns up in the publication
    copies). They are a new directory, not an override: nothing else is at that path.
